    WhoSpoke: Alm
    SentPrefabRef: {fileID: 0}
    Content: Hey, Aria's gonna be late for ~30 mins
    TriggerAfterThisLine: {fileID: 0}
  - HasAudio: 1
    DelayBeforeTyping: 1.5
    TypingDelay: 0.3
    WhoSpoke: Fli
    SentPrefabRef: {fileID: 0}
    Content: "Ah of course she is. It's only been a week \nsince she got discharged 
      from hospital."
    TriggerAfterThisLine: {fileID: 0}
  - HasAudio: 1
    DelayBeforeTyping: 0.5
    TypingDelay: 0.2
    WhoSpoke: Alm
    SentPrefabRef: {fileID: 0}
    Content: Guess we'll cut her some slacks
    TriggerAfterThisLine: {fileID: 0}
  - HasAudio: 1
    DelayBeforeTyping: 0.3
    TypingDelay: 0.2
    WhoSpoke: Fli
    SentPrefabRef: {fileID: 0}
    Content: Not really, she needs to catch up with everything.
    TriggerAfterThisLine: {fileID: 0}
  - HasAudio: 1
    DelayBeforeTyping: 1
    TypingDelay: 0.2
    WhoSpoke: Alm
    SentPrefabRef: {fileID: 0}
    Content: True, everyone's gotten used to Aria Mk. II, the OG has some big shoes
      to fill
